# Check Point SASE

> Check Point SASE is a cloud-delivered Secure Access Service Edge (SASE) platform that enables organizations to securely connect users, branch offices, devices, and applications through a globally distributed network with built-in security services.

Check Point SASE combines networking and security capabilities into a unified cloud platform. The platform includes Zero Trust Network Access (ZTNA), Secure Web Gateway (SWG), SD-WAN, SaaS security, secure internet access, identity-based access controls, and centralized cloud management.

The platform is designed for organizations seeking to replace legacy VPNs, secure SaaS usage, enable hybrid work, protect internet access, and simplify network and security management through a unified cloud-delivered architecture.

Check Point SASE is part of Check Point's cloud-delivered network security portfolio and focuses on secure access, connectivity, and protection for modern distributed organizations.

